case. Every Prize now stands on its base. See you at the EA release!DadeLight","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:40:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035469","verified_at":"2026-10-23T10:38:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5125930-1846018067933557","game_id":"steam-5125930","kind":"announcement","title":"EARLY ACCESS DATE REVEAL","summary":"Dear Clawlers,We finally have a date for the Early Access period, which will begin on October 30, 2026.Check the map to find out the exact time based on where you live.The cabinet is waiting for you,DadeLight","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T14:48:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933557","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:48:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5125930-1846018067925710","game_id":"steam-5125930","kind":"announcement","title":"v 0.1.12: Polish and Balances","summary":"Dear Clawlers,a new minor version is here, this version primarily contains fixes and balance adjustments, so we will group them into categories.ClawThe grip gauge now shows the needle at maximum only for balls that have absolutely no chance of not being grabbed, this applies even when accompanied by Prizes that boost the Claw's grip (up to 100%), such as the Storm Lantern.The grip gauge now updates while you keep aiming at the same ball. Before, it kept its old reading when the shelf changed und","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T10:35:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925710","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:48:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5125930-1844751498222079","game_id":"steam-5125930","kind":"update","title":"v 0.1.11: Claw Grip Update","summary":"Dear Clawlers,Another patch is here (also for Demo version), and it brings, among other things, a Claw Grip rework.New Claw Grip system\"Grip\" refers to the hold the claw exerts on the ball one is attempting to grasp. Each ball has different dimensions and traits, each of these peculiarities affects the Claw's grip.It is now possible to observe the Claw's grip on each ball in the pit: by positioning the Claw over a specific ball, you can see a new type of outline effect around the ball itself (wi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T16:29:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498222079","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:48:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5125930-1844115010492182","game_id":"steam-5125930","kind":"update","title":"v 0.1.10: Claw update","summary":"Dear Clawlers,another patch is here and it brings some interesting changes (also for Demo version): Turn the ClawHold Q or E, LB or RB on a pad to rotate the claw. It turns while you hold and stops when you let go, over the pile and on the way down alike.With this addition, it will be much easier to collect the balls near the cabinet walls. Tutorial has been updated.Menù UI reworkEvery menu and panel is redrawn, this is the new prototype look for Clawstral. New style for switches, tabs, slider k","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T14:20:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010492182","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:48:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5125930-1843481262695342","game_id":"steam-5125930","kind":"update","title":"v 0.1.9: BOSS UPDATE","summary":"Dear Clawlers,Version 0.1.9 is finally here (also for Demo!) and brings, among other things, the INFINITE and BOSS updates, two checkpoints achieved in our roadmap. Endless mode will be playable in the full version.Consequently the roadmap has been updated:From now, multiple rounds of 4 now end with a boss fight. Beat it and mine a mineral that stays with you for the rest of the run. And when a round runs out of grabs, the run no longer has to end right there: the Last Chance Wheel gets one spin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T13:52:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262695342","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:48:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5125930-1842846814448017","game_id":"steam-5125930","kind":"announcement","title":"v 0.1.7: 180 items!","summary":"Dear Clawlers,With the latest update (v 0.1.7), we have reached 180 unique items (Prizes and Buttons)!+6 new Prizes: Light Bulb, Dustpan, Kintsugi, Bauble, Bubble Wrap, Golden Hammer.+1 Button: Goblet+1 balls trait: FRAGILENew loading screenGeneral performance improvementThe main game and the demo share the same version, so you will find some new features in the demo as well, such as the addition of the FRAGILE trait.Feedback and suggestions are always welcome, I look forward to seeing you on th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T22:47:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814448017","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:48:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5125930-1842846814442751","game_id":"steam-5125930","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo available","summary":"Dear Clawlers,Clawstral official Demo is now available! Give it a try, feedback and suggestions are always welcome.If you like it, remember to add Clawstral to your Wishlist.Remember to join our Discord to stay up to date with the latest news.Sincerely,Davide, Clawstral","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T09:30:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814442751","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:48:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5125930":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:06Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:05Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5125930":"2026-10-26T08:43:06Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5125930":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:05Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:05Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:05Z"},"5185390":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:06Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5125930","app_id":5125930,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:33Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"e7c1856f1e1c1ca3db829ba3ede6a13c2a27762cb45ea6dabf7c2aeec5a465c2","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"A charming claw machine-themed roguelite! Never underestimate the claw!","publishers":[{"name":"DadeLight"}],"developers":[{"name":"DadeLight"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1793376000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full","is_early_access":true},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Reveal Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1789725044","trailer_category":2,"microtrailer